    "long_instructions": "## Implementing Loading, Error, and Empty States \r\n\r\nThis flight tracker app should work, but it's missing reliable visual cues to the user. Use your design ideas from the previous level to update `script.js`.\r\n\r\n1. **Decide on Placeholders:** Create variables to hold the loading, empty, and error state variables.\r\n\r\n2. **Implement Your States:** Update `script.js` to design your `Loading State`, `Empty State`, and `Error State'.\r\n\r\n3. **Make Your Brand Cohesive:** Revise `styles.css` and `index.html` to better match your site's personality.\r\n\r\n>**Testing Your App:**\r\nThis program is designed to choose an outcome randomly! Keep clicking \"Find flights\" and resetting the results until you have tested all three states."
